-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",258,{
[8225]="7002F987\n1\tTalk to Randgar at his farm\tRandgar lives on a small farm, south and east of Cliving, along the road. Inhild has asked you to go to the farmer Randgar and convince him to flee for her sake.\n",
[8226]="70047BDF\n1\tFind the Rangers in the lost patrol ([see journal]/10)\tThe Rangers can be found somewhere to the north-east of Haerondir on the battle plain between Ondoher's Folly and Dol Acharn. Anborn has asked you to seek the lost company of Rangers that left Haerondir in search of you and Anborn. You should search for them in Dagorlad.\n2\tSearch for the remaining Rangers near Dol Acharn\tDol Acharn can be found due east of Ondoher's Folly and the battle plain in Dagorlad. You have found six dead Rangers, but still seek the remaining four. You should search the foot of Dol Acharn for any survivors.\n3\tTalk to Faramir at the foot of Dol Acharn\tFaramir, son of Ondoher can be found at the foot of Dol Acharn. You have discovered Faramir, son of Ondoher while searching for the remaining Rangers. You should speak to him.\n",
[8227]="7001BBAD\n1\tTalk to Hunulf Munce\030Collect Eglan-treasures (total: 10)\tBeneath the ruins of Minas Eriol, to the west of Hunulf's encampment, lay a den of spiders. Many goods and valuables, necessary for the Eglain's continued livelihood have gone missing within. Hunulf asked you to make your way into the dangerous valley beneath the goblin infested ruin of Minas Eriol. He warned that spiders there are in possession of many Eglan-treasures that must be recovered for his people.\n",
[8228]="7005F83D\n1\tFelgar has asked you to deliver some missives to scouts. Two scouts are on the level below Felgar's location: one on a bridge to the east, the other to the west. The third scout is waiting two levels below Felgar's location, in Aslíf.\t\n2\tCompleted\tYou have completed Felgar's request.\n",
[8229]="70041787\n1\tSearch the scattered debris (total: 6)\tThe capture site can be found to the north-east of Celebros. You should search the capture site for signs of the missing heirloom.\n2\tExamine the shimmering debris\030Search the area near the reflecting pool\tThe shimmering debris is located near the reflecting pool of the capture site. You should examine the shimmering debris.\n3\tCollect the lost heirloom\tThe heirloom box is located near the reflecting pool of the capture site. You should take the heirloom box.\n4\tTalk to Celebros\tCelebros is located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani. You should speak with Celebros.\n",
[8230]="7005FA49\n1\tEnsnared Longbeard miners can be found in Ormgren in Gloomingtarn. Lokur has informed you that several Longbeard miners exploring Ormgren have been ensnared by unsettled glow-worms. You should help free the ensnared miners.\t\n2\tTalk to Lokur\tLokur can be found in Ormgren. You have freed many of the ensnared Longbeard miners in Ormgren. You should return to Lokur.\n",
[8231]="7002823A\n1\tCollect goods (total: 4)\tThe caravan to Wulf's Cleft is travelling the southern road out of Avardin. Bedwur asked you to raid the caravan heading to Wulf's Cleft and return to him the goods he sold to Saruman.\n2\tBring the goods to Bedwur in Avardin\tBedwur is in Avardin in the central Starkmoor. Bedwur will want to receive the goods so he can ready them for the next auction.\n",
[8232]="700682DC\n1\tSearch the nearby satchel\tThe wandering soul seems to be muttering to itself. Perhaps you should search the vicinity for any clues as to its identity.\n2\tFollow the trail north-west\tAn herbal satchel found by the wandering spirit leaves trail leading to the north-west.\n3\tSearch the wreckage\tThe trail led you to a wrecked boat in the shallows. It must have run aground during a horrible storm.\n4\tExamine the water-logged journal\tSearching the wreckage, you find a water-logged journal. Perhaps this can help the wandering spirit.\n5\tTrack the scattered jetsam\tThere seems to be a trail of jetsam leading away from the first trail of herbs.\n6\tFind the next pile of debris\tMore and more debris scatters the more south you wander.\n7\tFind the next sign of jetsam\tAs the trail narrows, it leads you further into the shallows.\n8\tFind where the trail ends\tThe trail is getting thinner and harder to track. You must be getting closer.\n9\tSearch for the final clue\t\n10\tTalk to Heshla\tThe locket you found contains a small sketch of two people locked in an embrace. One of the people bears a striking resemblance to the wandering spirit. You should return this to the lost soul. Heshla can be found south-east of the wreckage.\n",
[8233]="70052CE6\n1\tDefeat lost spirits (total: 12)\tLost spirits can be found along the river Gladden. You should defeat lost spirits.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many lost spirits.\n",
[8234]="7004544A\n1\tSearch for the missing Wose\tThe last place the missing Wose was seen was in the Drúadan Forest. You should search for the missing Wose.\n2\tSearch for the missing Wose\tYou should follow the footprints and continue searching for the missing Wose.\n3\tDefeat the unknown creature\tDefeat the strange creatures that scared off the Wose you found.\n4\tSpeak with Ghân-buri-Ghân\tGhân-buri-Ghân can be found in Drû Bhûta. You should speak with Ghân-buri-Ghân.\n",
[8235]="70071614\n1\tDefeat drakes in Ushumût (total: 12)\030Destroy wild-drake eggs (total: 10)\tThe wild-drakes nest at Ushumût, the ancient bones of dragons. The drakes present a danger to everyone nearby. You should defeat drakes and destroy wild-drake eggs at Ushumût.\n2\tTalk to Râsabur\tYou have done much to clear the drakes from Ushumût. You should return to Râsabur.\n",
[8236]="70042F57\n1\tMablung's Rangers can be found throughout Osgiliath. Mablung has asked you to seek the Rangers he sent to scout the surface of Osgiliath and order them to return to his post.\t\n2\tTalk to Mablung in the sewers of Osgiliath\tMablung can be found in the culverts of Osgiliath. You have found several of Mablung's Rangers and should now return to him in the culverts.\n",
[8237]="70066772\n1\tCollect salvage wood (total: 5)\tAradax has asked you to collect scrap wood from around Tathrendalf.\n2\tTalk to Aradax\tYou have retrieved some salvage wood from around Lothgobel and should return it to Aradax in Lothgobel. Talk to Aradax in Lothgobel.\n",
[8238]="7004038A\n1\tSpeak with the Watchman of Dínadab\tThe Watchman can be found in Dínadab in northern Lamedon. You should speak with the Watchman about what should be done next against the Corsair threat.\n2\tInvestigate the streets of Lothgobel for signs of Corsair intrusion\tLothgobel is in central Lamedon. You should investigate Lothgobel for signs of Corsair intrusion.\n3\tHomes can be found in Lothgobel in central Lamedon. You should search homes for signs of Gondorians or the invading Corsairs.\t\n4\tFind and confront Jajax\tYou have seen a great deal of evidence showing that the enemies here are uniformly loyal to a Corsair named Jajax. You should seek out this captain and confront him about his ransacking of Lothgobel.\n",
[8239]="70066743\n1\tDefeat vicious boars (total: 8)\tAlagiel has asked you to defeat vicious boars near Lothgobel.\n2\tTalk to Alagiel\tTell Alagiel that you have culled some boars.\n",
[8240]="7001ACB9\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Acquaintance of the Galadhrim.\n",
[8241]="7001ACB2\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered a Friend of the Galadhrim.\n",
[8242]="7001ACBA\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Ally of the Galadhrim.\n",
[8243]="7001ACBB\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered Kindred of the Galadhrim.\n",
[8244]="70064EF7\n1\tTalk to Rock\tBy completing this quest, you will receive a Lothlórien barter currency allowance.\n",
[8245]="7001900A\n1\tBring battle plans to Sileffind\030Collect battle plans (total: 5)\tSileffind is in Caras Galadhon. Orcs and goblins on the outskirts of Lothlórien and throughout Moria may hold battle plans that will help the Elves prepare for the attack. Sileffind has asked you to defeat Orcs and goblins and gather battle plans from them.\n",
[8246]="7001900B\n1\tDefeat Orcs and goblins within the dungeons of Moria (total: 15)\tStrong Orcs and goblins can be found within the many dangerous dungeons within Moria: the Forges of Khazad-Dûm, the Forgotten Treasury, the Grand Stair, and the Sixteenth Hall. Donndageth has asked you to defeat Orcs and goblins within the dangerous dungeons of Moria to limit the forces that might attack Lothlórien.\n2\tTalk to Donndageth at Caras Galadhon\tDonndageth is at Caras Galadhon. You have defeated many Orcs and goblins within the dangerous dungeons of Moria and should return to Donndageth with news of your triumphs.\n",
[8247]="7001900C\n1\tPick up supplies outside the entrance to Caras Galadhon\tMithenn inside Caras Galadhon wishes you to carry supplies he left outside the gates of that city to the base of Talan Fanuidhol. Mithenn wants to ensure that the flets on the outskirts of exposed Fanuidhol are well-supplied for the Orc-attack.\n2\tTalk to Faelleron at Talan Fanuidhol\tFaelleron is at the base of Talan Fanuidhol. You have delivered a crate of supplies to Talan Fanuidhol and should now speak with Faelleron.\n",
[8248]="70019D3B\n1\tPick up a crate from the stack near Aesgyl\tA stack of crates is next to Aesgyl on Telain Galadhrim. Sileffind is at the entrance to Caras Galadhon. You have been asked to carry a crate to Sileffind at the entrance of Caras Galadhon.\n2\tTalk to Sileffind at the entrance to Caras Galadhon\tSileffind is at the entrance to Caras Galadhon. You have delivered a crate to Sileffind and should now speak with him.\n",
[8249]="70057F1A\n1\tCatch wayward verses (total: 6)\tWayward verses can be found around the Houses of Lore in Minas Tirith. You should collect wayward verses for the hopeful poet.\n2\tBring the wayward verses to Colladan\tColladan is located in the Houses of Lore in Minas Tirith. Bring the wayward verses to Colladan.\n",
[8250]="7000D75E\n1\tBring the flowers to Avery Crabapple\030Collect a marigold\030Collect a violet\030Collect a primrose\tMarigolds can be found near the stone circle outside Michel Delving, violets near the stone circle beyond the Bree West-gate, and primroses near the stone circle above Celondim. Realizing that he cannot muster the courage to speak to the lady of his affections face-to-face, Avery Crabapple has requested help from you to gather a combination of flowers from all corners of Eriador.\n",
[8251]="700017AC\n1\tCollect tough boar-meat at Minas Vrûn (total: 8)\tBoars have taken over the ruins of Minas Vrûn, east of Amon Raith. Amarion has asked you to hunt the boars of Minas Vrûn so that he can feed the farmers that have taken refuge at Amon Raith.\n2\tBring tough boar-meat to Amarion\tThe Ranger Amarion is at Amon Raith, west of Annúndir and east of the Greenway. Amarion is waiting for you to return with the boar-meat with which he hopes to feed the farmers under his care.\n",
[8252]="7006C8A5\n1\tCollect perfectly good oranges (total: 8)\tMeliri wants you to collect any perfectly good oranges you find lying on the ground. They are found in the orange groves of Burukíri in Ambarûl.\n2\tBring the oranges to Meliri\tYou collected the perfectly good oranges you found lying on the ground. You should return to Meliri at Burukíri in Ambarûl.\n",
[8253]="7000978D\n1\tEarn Astiul's trust\030Earn Forchon's trust\030Earn Naethmunn's trust\tThe Rangers Astiul, Forchon, and Naethmunn are at the Ranger-camp on the island of Tinnudir, in Evendim. Calenglad has asked you to render your aid to three of his brethren. When they are satisfied that you are true of heart and do not harbour plans to plunder the tombs of the Dúnedain, he will consider your errand again.\n2\tTalk to Calenglad\tCalenglad is at the Ranger-camp on the island of Tinnudir, in Evendim. You have satisfied his brethren of your true heart and should now return to Calenglad to ask him again for aid in acquiring the Silithar for Aragorn.\n",
[8254]="700453DF\n1\tBring the bright-lily to Lhôs-uksa-Wôt\tLhôs-uksa-Wôt is near the bright-lily glade. You should bring a bright-lily to Lhôs-uksa-Wôt.\n2\tCollect bright-lilies (total: 12)\tBright-lilies can be found in the Drúadan Forest. You should collect bright-lilies.\n3\tDecorate Wose buildings in Drû Bhûta (total: 6)\tDrû Bhûta is located in Taur Drúadan. You should return to Drû Bhûta and decorate the village with bright-lilies.\n",
[8255]="700032F1\n1\tSearch the deer-carcass for the lucky sling-stone\tThe bear den is north of Overhill, located on the slopes above the Bolestones. Everard Holebourne has asked you to retrieve his lucky sling-stone from the carcass of the deer he killed, which was dragged off to a bear den.\n2\tBring the lucky sling-stone to Everard Holebourne\tEverard awaits you at his home in the middle of Overhill. Everard Holebourne will be pleased to have his sling-stone returned to him.\n",
[8256]="70018FC1\n1\tRecover arrows from Orc corpses near the border of Lórien (total: 5)\tOrc corpses are strewn along the north and south borders of Lórien, east of Echad Andestel. Celegúien has asked you to find the bodies of Orcs slain by arrows along the outskirts of Lórien, and warned you against getting too close to the border. She wants you to recover the arrows so that they may be used again against the Orcs.\n2\tBring Elf-arrows to Celegúien\tCelegúien is in Echad Andestel, the camp along the banks of Nimrodel, west of the border of Lórien. You have recovered arrows from the slain Orcs along the border of Lórien, and should bring them now to Celegúien.\n",
})
